  "title": "Chicken Thigh Fricassee with Mushrooms and Rosemary",
  "description": "Chicken thighs slowly simmer with sliced mushrooms, garlic, and rosemary in white wine. Enjoy with a crusty loaf of baguette.",
  "authors": [
